{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03945","headline":"人日宴大明宫恩赐彩缕人胜应制 · 李适","name":"人日宴大明宫恩赐彩缕人胜应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱城待凤韶年至，碧殿疏龙淑气来。\n宝帐金屏人已帖，图花学鸟胜初裁。\n林香近接宜春苑，山翠遥添献寿杯。\n向夕凭高风景丽，天文垂耀象昭回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03945.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03945","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}